      '- **Weatherhead & Service Riser:** Inspecting for cracked weatherheads, missing mastic seals, and water intrusion pathways entering conduit.',
      '- **Meter Enclosure:** Checking for coastal corrosion, rusted lugs, proper bonding to the grounding electrode, and unmetered utility tap safety.',
      '- **Overhead Clearance:** Ensuring service drop conductors maintain at least 10 feet of clearance above grade and 3 feet of clearance from openable windows and swimming pools.',
