    title: 'Do You Need an Electrician for an EV Charger in South Florida?',
    excerpt: 'Level 1 vs Level 2 charging, NEC continuous load calculations, hardwired vs NEMA 14-50 outlets, panel capacity rules, and Florida municipal permit requirements.',
