    title: 'Electrical Safety After a Florida Storm: Panel Flooding, Downed Lines & Generator Safety',
    excerpt: 'Crucial electrical safety rules after a South Florida hurricane or tropical storm. Handling flooded panels, downed service drops, and safe generator operation.',
